  "dek": "The team reaches eighth while Tufa holds off Chen; mikelou1’s late advance redraws the provisional medal boundary.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition — ARC-AGI-3\nArtificial Agency Lab reaches eighth after an overnight score event, closing to within 0.23 of seventh. Tufa remains first ahead of Chen. mikelou1 enters the provisional gold band and the final gold score rises. We also separate ARC Prize’s DeepSeek evaluation from the Kaggle team race.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-14-morning-arc-3",
